ter-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-9 rounded-md px-3 w-full mt-auto text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors duration-300\">مشاهده جزئیات</button></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-16\"><div class=\"glass-effect rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 animate-pulse-glow\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 gradient-text\">سوالی دارید؟</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6\">با مشاورین ما تماس بگیرید تا بهترین خدمات برای نیاز شما را انتخاب کنیم</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-11 rounded-md px-8 gradient-bg text-white hover:opacity-90 transition-all duration-200 transform hover:scale-105 shadow-lg\">مشاوره رایگان</button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border-input bg-background hover:text-accent-foreground h-11 rounded-md px-8 border-2 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all duration-200\">مشاهده نمونه کارها</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-white relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-30\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-200 to-pink-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-72 h-72 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-200 to-indigo-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl\"></div></div><div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 relative z-10\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">چرا <span class=\"gradient-text\">عصر سئو</span>؟</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">دلایل انتخاب ما به عنوان شریک دیجیتال مارکتینگ شما</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground group hover-lift h-full border-0 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden animate-slide-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:0s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-blue-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-all duration-300\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 text-center pb-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex p-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-blue-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-6 w-6 text-white\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:gradient-text transition-all duration-300\">تجربه ۵+ ساله</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-center relative z-10\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">با بیش از ۵ سال تجربه در حوزه دیجیتال مارکتینگ، تیم ما آماده ارائه بهترین خدمات است.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground group hover-lift h-full border-0 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden animate-slide-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:0.1s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-green-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-all duration-300\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 text-center pb-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex p-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-green-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock h-6 w-6 text-white\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:gradient-text transition-all duration-300\">تحویل به موقع</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-center relative z-10\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">تمام پروژه‌ها در زمان تعیین شده و با کیفیت بالا تحویل داده می‌شوند.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground group hover-lift h-full border-0 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden animate-slide-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:0.2s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-all duration-300\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 text-center pb-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex p-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-purple-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-6 w-6 text-white\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:gradient-text transition-all duration-300\">تیم متخصص</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-center relative z-10\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">تیم ما شامل بهترین متخصصان سئو، طراحی وب و دیجیتال مارکتینگ کشور است.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground group hover-lift h-full border-0 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden animate-slide-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:0.30000000000000004s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-orange-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-all duration-300\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 text-center pb-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex p-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-orange-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-6 w-6 text-white\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:gradient-text transition-all duration-300\">نتایج اثبات شده</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-center relative z-10\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">بیش از ۵۰۰ پروژه موفق و رشد متوسط ۳۰۰٪ در فروش مشتریان ما.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground group hover-lift h-full border-0 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden animate-slide-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:0.4s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-red-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-all duration-300\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 text-center pb-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex p-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 to-red-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-6 w-6 text-white\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:gradient-text transition-all duration-300\">ضمانت کیفیت</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-center relative z-10\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">تمام خدمات ما با ضمانت کیفیت و پشتیبانی مادام‌العمر ارائه می‌شود.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground group hover-lift h-full border-0 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden animate-slide-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:0.5s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-indigo-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-all duration-300\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 text-center pb-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex p-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-indigo-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb h-6 w-6 text-white\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:gradient-text transition-all duration-300\">راه‌حل‌های نوآورانه</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-center relative z-10\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">استفاده از جدیدترین تکنولوژی‌ها و روش‌های نوین بازاریابی.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground group hover-lift h-full border-0 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden animate-slide-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:0.6000000000000001s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-500 to-teal-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-all duration-300\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 text-center pb-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex p-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 to-teal-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target h-6 w-6 text-white\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:gradient-text transition-all duration-300\">استراتژی هدفمند</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-center relative z-10\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">تمام استراتژی‌ها بر اساس اهداف کسب‌وکار شما طراحی می‌شوند.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground group hover-lift h-full border-0 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden animate-slide-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:0.7000000000000001s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-pink-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-all duration-300\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 text-center pb-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex p-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 to-pink-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-headphones h-6 w-6 text-white\"><path d=\"M3 14h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:gradient-text transition-all duration-300\">پشتیبانی ۲۴/۷</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-center relative z-10\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">تیم پشتیبانی ما همیشه آماده پاسخگویی به سوالات شما است.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-20\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">روند <span class=\"gradient-text\">همکاری</span> ما</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">از ابتدای همکاری تا دستیابی به نتایج، این مسیر را با هم می‌پیماییم</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 relative\"><div class=\"hidden md:block absolute top-1/2 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-500 -z-10\"></div><div class=\"text-center animate-zoom-in\" style=\"animation-delay:0s\"><div class=\"relative mb-4\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 mx-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg\">۱</div></div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">مشاوره رایگان</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">بررسی نیازها و اهداف</p></div><div class=\"text-center animate-zoom-in\" style=\"animation-delay:0.2s\"><div class=\"relative mb-4\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 mx-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg\">۲</div></div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">طراحی استراتژی</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">تدوین نقشه راه مناسب</p></div><div class=\"text-center animate-zoom-in\" style=\"animation-delay:0.4s\"><div class=\"relative mb-4\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 mx-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg\">۳</div></div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">اجرای پروژه</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">پیاده‌سازی حرفه‌ای</p></div><div class=\"text-center animate-zoom-in\" style=\"animation-delay:0.6000000000000001s\"><div class=\"relative mb-4\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 mx-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg\">۴</div></div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">گزارش و بهینه‌سازی</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">تحلیل نتایج و بهبود</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-purple-50 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20\"><div class=\"absolute top-1/4 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-300 to-purple-300 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl animate-float\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-1/4 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-300 to-pink-300 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl animate-float\" style=\"animation-delay:4s\"></div></div><div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 relative z-10\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">نظر <span class=\"gradient-text\">مشتریان</span> ما</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">رضایت مشتریان، بزرگترین افتخار ماست. ببینید آنها چه می‌گویند</p></div><div c